<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="11">
<name>Control System</name>
<section id="1001O_S001F" variety="S001F">
<name>Cruise Control</name>
<ttl id="1001O_S001F_74QXD_T00FC" variety="T00FC">
<name>Radar Cruise Control System</name>
<para id="RM00000064P00DX" category="C" type-id="3030H" name-id="5914Z-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P1570/73</dtccode>
<dtcname>Radar Sensor Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000064P00DX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CB500000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This DTC is also output when the vehicle information sent from the millimeter wave radar sensor assembly is abnormal. In that case, perform initialization so that the radar sensor recognizes the vehicle information.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P1570/73</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Control vehicle speed (40 - 100 km/h), cruise control main switch ON (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Millimeter wave radar sensor assembly malfunction or improper initialization</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Millimeter Wave Radar Sensor Assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000064P00DX_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000064P00DX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000064P00DX_04_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CB600000">
<testtitle>Check DTCs (Pre-crash Safety System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the screen display to display the "System Diagnosis Menu/Pre-crash" screen.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Select "DTC Freeze Data" and check the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.06in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.07in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B2055 is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B2055 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000064P00DX_04_0012" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000064P00DX_04_0011" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000064P00DX_04_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CEJ00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs using SST (TaSCAN). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000064C00EX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000064P00DX_04_0013" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000064P00DX_04_0013" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CEK00000">
<testtitle>Check DTCs (Radar Cruise Control System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Put the vehicle in the conditions under which the DTC is detected.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The system cannot detect the malfunction unless the detection conditions are met.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test2>
<ptxt>Drive within the cruise control set vehicle speed range.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the cruise control main switch ON and put the system in vehicle-to-vehicle distance mode standby.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000064C00EX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.04in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>P1570 is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>P1570 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000064P00DX_04_0014" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000064P00DX_04_0015" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000064P00DX_04_0014">
<testtitle>Go to Problem Symptom Simulation Method<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY04BX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000064P00DX_04_0011">
<testtitle>Go to the relevant diagnostic trouble code (B2055)<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000DB900JX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000064P00DX_04_0015">
<testtitle>Replace Engine Control Computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002ADB004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>